    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Dooley Group bring to the market this 4 Bedroom Detached proeprty on Circa 1.2 Acres.\n\nLocated just 5 minutes from the town of Newcastle West and only 35 minutes from Limerick City, this property ticks all the boxes for any potential purchaser.\n\nSituated on Circa 1.2 Acres it offers the perfect opportunity for anyone who may be looking to build on or upsize from town living to a country location.\n\nThe property comes to the market with 4 spacious bedrooms, sitting room, kitchen with solid fuel stove and main bathroom. It is serviced by mains water and recently installed bio cycle unit and Oil Fired Central Heating.\n\nExternally there is a large detached garage and electric car charger.\n\nThis proeprty must be viewed to be apreciated. Viewings are strictly by appointment through sole agents REA Dooley Group on 069-61888.\n\nEntrance Hallway - 25'8 (7.82m) x 4'4 (1.32m)\nLino Flooring\n\nSitting Room - 10'9 (3.28m) x 13'7 (4.14m)\nLaminate Flooring\n\nKitchen - 13'9 (4.19m) x 14'8 (4.47m)\nLino flooring, fitted kitchen and solid fuel stove\n\nBathroom - 9'7 (2.92m) x 5'6 (1.68m)\nTiled floor to ceiling, wc, whb, bath and electric shower\n\nBedroom 1 - 14'1 (4.29m) x 10'11 (3.33m)\nCarpet flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 9'6 (2.9m) x 8'1 (2.46m)\nCarpet flooring\n\nBedroom 3 - 14'1 (4.29m) x 8'3 (2.51m)\nLaminate flooring\n\nBedroom 4 - 14'2 (4.32m) x 8'0 (2.44m)\nCarpet flooring\n\nDetached Garage\n\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
